  "releaseNotes": "# Intrada.NET Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\nThis project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).\n\n## 7.6.0 - 2026-01-21\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- Improve the support for vehicle types by handling combined values. To accomodate this, the `VehicleType`-enum is now a flagged enum\n\n### Features\n\n- Add support for retrieving plate symbol locations with `IPlateResult.Symbols`",
